@startuml worker_architecture
!pragma layout smetana

title 投影工作组架构 Workspace

hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #334155
    LifeLineBorderColor #334155
    ParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
}

actor "客户端" as Client
participant "REST / RestAlchemy\n控制器" as API
database "源表\n规范性实质 + 联系 + 事实" as SOURCE
database "永久域名\noutbox" as OUTBOX
participant "任务投影器\n1 task 在 outbox event" as PROJECTOR
database "类型任务\n投影" as TASKS
participant "调整的工作组\n0..N 活跃的插槽" as POOL
database "租 exact scope key\nlease + fencing token" as CLAIM
participant "工人机" as WORKER
database "已准备的投影\n绑定 + 状态 / 图片" as READY
database "公众活动存储器" as EVENTS
participant "控制器 WebSocket\n重复 + 播放" as DISPATCHER
actor "客户端 WebSocket" as WS

Client -> API : 改变状态的请求
activate API
API -> SOURCE : 修改 真理来源行
API -> OUTBOX : 添加一个不变的事件\n在同一交易中
API --> Client : 已注定的即时回复
deactivate API

note over API,OUTBOX
  POST 创建消息:
  MESSAGE + MESSAGE_PLACEMENT
  + 创作权 USER_MESSAGE_BINDING
  + USER_MESSAGE_STATE + outbox.
  接收者状态通过 fanout.
end note

OUTBOX -> PROJECTOR : 记录的事件
PROJECTOR -> TASKS : immutable task(outbox_event_uuid, kind, scope)\nunique derivation; 没有 coalescing
TASKS -> POOL : 期待着一个明显的工作\n(没有搜索缺失的行)
POOL -> CLAIM : 抓住一个精确的 scope key
CLAIM --> POOL : 独占租/所有权
POOL -> WORKER : 在设置的限制范围内指定 N
activate WORKER
WORKER -> SOURCE : 读取最后一个记录状态
note right of WORKER
  只有 scope=topic:
  MESSAGE.created_at DESC
  14:20 -> 14:19 -> 14:15
  fanout batch: user_uuid ASC, default 1000, max 5000
  在之后 batch — checkpoint 其他 bounded fairness
end note
group 一个 DB transaction
  WORKER -> READY : 没有任何可能的 materialization / batch upsert
  WORKER -> EVENTS : durable ready rows; unique derivation key
end
WORKER -> CLAIM : 让我们安全地释放
deactivate WORKER

EVENTS -> DISPATCHER : 稳定的准备记录
DISPATCHER -> WS : 发送 / 重复 / 播放
note over EVENTS,WS
  Reconnect: cursor + high-watermark + replay + buffer/drain 没有 gap.
  At-least-once; client dedupe 根据 event UUID.
  Membership generation 压抑 data events 在之后 revoke.
end note

note over SOURCE,READY
  公开链接 UUID 是一个直角 UUID-属性.
  物理列 *_uuid 仍然是索引外键.
  集装箱的组件将在唯一的绑定上存储
  用户的容器,但不是在消息绑定.
  MESSAGE_PLACEMENT.uuid — 公开的 UUID 信息.
  MESSAGE.uuid — 国内 canonical content UUID;
  UUID USER_MESSAGE_BINDING 保持隐藏 row identity.
  FOLDER 保存一次; normalized FOLDER_ITEM = source of truth.
  USER_FOLDER_BINDING 存储访问,计数器和 read-only JSONB
  folder_items_snapshot (empty=[]), version/updated_at.
  文件自动读取活动文件 USER_STREAM_BINDING + STREAM.is_archived=false:
  All chats = 所有的; Personal = STREAM.private=true; Channels = STREAM.private=false.
end note

note over TASKS,READY
  拥有路由:
  fanout/placement state -> topic(project, topic)
  reaction snapshot -> message(project, canonical message)
  stream aggregates -> user-stream(project, user, stream)
  folder_projection -> user-folder(project, user, folder)
  topic aggregates -> user-topic(project, user, topic)
  其他 shared rows 他们要求明确的 scope; fallback 在 topic 禁止使用.
  Topic-worker 没有执行 unsafe read-modify-write shared rows.
  folder_projection 他写道 snapshot + counts + version/time
  + 所有的 ready events 在一个 worker DB transaction.
  API 阅读一个 indexed row/page 没有 N+1/json_agg/COUNT/custom SQL.
end note

note over PROJECTOR,CLAIM
  Lifecycle: pending -> leased/running -> completed/failed -> DLQ.
  Lease expiry, attempts/backoff, max attempts, reaper/reconciliation.
  Atomic counter delta 只有在 exactly-once effect guard
  根据 outbox_event_uuid; 否则 scope worker recomputes/writes.
end note

note over API,OUTBOX
  GET/列表在索引读取后结束
  他没有创造任何东西. outbox/任务.
end note

@enduml
